.TH ARGUS 1 "November 2026" "argus 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
argus \- fast, modular OSINT CLI tool for Discord Snowflakes, usernames, and cross-platform pivoting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B argus
[\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]...
.br
.B argus scan
[\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-pivot\fR] [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-all\-sites\fR] [\fB\-E\fR|\fB\-\-email\-sites\fR] [\fB\-D\fR|\fB\-\-dorks\fR] [\fB\-\-intelx\fR] [\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-H\fR|\fB\-\-html\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-view\fR] [\fB\-x\fR|\fB\-\-proxy\fR \fIURL\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fISEC\fR] \fITARGET\fR
.br
.B argus snowflake
[\fB\-j\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-H\fR|\fB\-\-html\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-view\fR] [\fB\-x\fR|\fB\-\-proxy\fR \fIURL\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fISEC\fR] \fIUSER_ID\fR
.br
.B argus tui
[\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-file\fR \fIFILE\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-pivot\fR] [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-all\-sites\fR] [\fB\-x\fR|\fB\-\-proxy\fR \fIURL\fR] [\fITARGET\fR]
.br
.B argus config
.br
.B argus man
[\fB\-\-roff\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B argus
is a high-performance, modular OSINT reconnaissance tool engineered to pivot seamlessly from an alphanumeric username handle or a 64-bit Discord Snowflake User ID into public Discord metadata, cross-platform profiles, and third-party indexers.

It executes concurrent non-blocking asynchronous queries, performs pure offline bit-shift math on Discord IDs, parses profile biographies for leaked identifiers, and aggregates intelligence into unified Pydantic reports with rich terminal formatting or JSON export.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B scan \fITARGET\fR
Smart scan that automatically classifies \fITARGET\fR as either a 17\(en20 digit Discord Snowflake ID or an alphanumeric username handle:
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
\fBSnowflake Target:\fR Decodes creation date, worker ID, process ID, and increment offline. Concurrently queries Discord REST API v10 and CordCat. If a username is resolved and \fB\-\-pivot\fR is enabled, triggers username enumeration.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBUsername Target:\fR Concurrently runs Maigret profile sweep across developer/gaming platforms and audits GitHub public commit events. Any discovered email addresses or Discord IDs are chained into breach lookups (HIBP/LeakCheck) and Snowflake analysis.
.RE
.TP
.B snowflake \fIUSER_ID\fR
Decodes a 64-bit Discord Snowflake ID purely offline using bit-shifting arithmetic:
.RS
.PP
Timestamp = (id >> 22) + 1420070400000 (ms since Discord Epoch Jan 1, 2015 UTC)
.PP
Also queries Discord Bot REST API and CordCat indexer if configured.
.RE
.TP
.B config
Inspects active configuration files, displaying discovered \fB.env\fR locations and masked statuses for all API keys.
.TP
.B tui \fI[TARGET]\fR
Interactive terminal user interface dashboard. Navigates investigation reports with keyboard shortcuts and menu-driven drill-downs. Also available as \fBexplore\fR.
.TP
.B man [\fB\-\-roff\fR]
Displays the comprehensive terminal manual page. With \fB\-\-roff\fR, outputs standard UNIX troff format.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print tool version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print command help synopsis and exit.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pivot
When scanning a Discord Snowflake ID, automatically pivot into cross-platform username enumeration.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-all\-sites
Instructs Maigret to scan all available sites in its database instead of top-ranked developer and gaming platforms.
.TP
.BR \-E ", " \-\-email\-sites
Probe 120+ platforms via Holehe for registered accounts matching discovered or target emails.
.TP
.BR \-D ", " \-\-dorks
Generate pre-computed Google Dork URLs targeting pastes, leaks, and documents.
.TP
.BR \-\-intelx
Query Intelligence X darknet archives and public leak databases for target selector.
.TP
.BR \-M ", " \-\-metadata
Inspect avatar image EXIF metadata, camera specifications, and technical dimensions.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-json
Output raw formatted JSON to stdout. Disables terminal animations for pipeline compatibility.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-out " \fIFILE\fR"
Write structured investigation JSON report to \fIFILE\fR.
.TP
.BR \-H ", " \-\-html " \fIFILE\fR"
Write standalone HTML investigation report with interactive telemetry and no external dependencies to \fIFILE\fR.
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-view
Open HTML investigation report in default system browser (creates a temporary file if \fB\-\-html\fR is omitted).
.TP
.BR \-x ", " \-\-proxy " \fIURL\fR"
Route network traffic through HTTP, HTTPS, or SOCKS5 proxy (e.g. \fBsocks5://127.0.0.1:9050\fR).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-timeout " \fISECONDS\fR"
Configurable HTTP timeout in seconds per module (default: 15).

.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES & CONFIGURATION
.B argus
reads settings from \fB.env\fR in the current working directory, \fB~/.argus/.env\fR, and system environment variables:
.TP
.B ARGUS_PROXY
Proxy URL for outbound requests (\fBhttp://\fR, \fBhttps://\fR, \fBsocks5://\fR). Falls back to standard \fBALL_PROXY\fR, \fBHTTPS_PROXY\fR, \fBHTTP_PROXY\fR.
.TP
.B DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
Bot authorization token used for Discord REST API v10 user lookups, badge decoding, and CDN URLs.
.TP
.B CORDCAT_API_KEY
API key for CordCat v2 historical usernames and FiveM / CFX lookups.
.TP
.B HIBP_API_KEY
Have I Been Pwned API key for breach notifications on discovered email addresses.
.TP
.B LEAKCHECK_API_KEY
LeakCheck API key for exposure checks.
.TP
.B GITHUB_TOKEN
Optional GitHub Personal Access Token to increase API rate limits from 60 to 5,000 requests/hour.

.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Decode Discord user ID offline:
.RS
.B argus snowflake 155149108183695360
.RE
.PP
Scan a Discord Snowflake and pivot to discovered username:
.RS
.B argus scan 155149108183695360 \-\-pivot
.RE
.PP
Scan a username handle and export to JSON:
.RS
.B argus scan torvalds \-\-out report.json
.RE
.PP
Output JSON to stdout for jq parsing:
.RS
.B argus scan 155149108183695360 \-\-json | jq .snowflake
.RE
.PP
Display the interactive manual page:
.RS
.B argus man
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Invalid input arguments or fatal error.

